      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">Read 60 min</span><span class=\"chip\">Build 120 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 24 of 45</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Meeting Room &amp; Calendar Scheduler</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Book rooms without double-booking, repeat a meeting every week, invite people, find a time that suits everyone, and stay correct when fifty people click \"Book\" at the same second. We start with a school timetable and finish with a lock-ordered, thread-safe design in Java, Python and C++.</p>\n"
